5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The current system is failing. We need to define the scope of work before assigning it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I feel like the burden is uneven. Some of us are here more than others.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am worried about the social friction this is causing. We need a sustainable solution.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I just want to know who is paying for the supplies. It’s always my wallet.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just want the rooms to be predictable. It’s hard to guess what state they’ll be in.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, how do we measure ""here more""? We need data, not feelings.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, it’s obvious. But I agree, we need to look at the facts.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, the cost is a valid concern. Let’s look at the receipts.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Victoria, yes! And I want to see how long the cleaning actually takes.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I can look at the bathroom grout. It gets dirty so fast.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will time a full cleaning pass. I need to know the true hour count.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,I’ll check the wall calendar for absences. That will show who is actually here.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will read the note left by the previous tenants. Their experience might help us.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I’ll check the bathroom spray stock and the tin’s receipts.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll look at what each housemate counts as done. That explains the confusion.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. Let’s gather this information before we decide.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mio,,Sounds good. I’ll get the calendar data.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will review the previous tenants' note.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
