35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The timing data is clear. A full pass takes over an hour. The management rate is high.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,The calendar shows two of us are away most months. The kitchen use is concentrated on a few people.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The previous tenants divided rooms permanently and stopped speaking. The chat logs show rows start with reminders.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,The receipts show we buy spray twice a month. The timing confirms it takes a long time.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The definition of ""done"" varies wildly. The grout gets dirty in eleven days.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, if two people are away, the workload shifts. We need a system that accounts for absence.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, exactly. And the kitchen work is mostly done by three people.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, the cost is significant. But the social cost of the previous system was higher.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Victoria, I agree. But I still need to know the monthly cost.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Ryuji, if the grout gets dirty so fast, maybe we need more frequent, smaller tasks?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"The management office charges 4,200 yen an hour. That’s expensive for a year.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,"If we hire a service, we need to split that cost. But who is here to pay?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,The previous tenants' note is a warning. Permanent assignments led to silence.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"The spray costs 2,300 yen a month. That’s not trivial.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I think a fixed rota might be better than permanent assignments.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I am leaning towards a fixed weekly rota. It’s predictable and fair.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,I agree. A rota accounts for absences better than permanent roles.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,A rota seems safer than the previous tenants' method.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,"As long as we track the costs, I’m fine with a rota.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,A rota would help me know what to expect.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
